<PageTitle>Arishma Lead Workspace</PageTitle>
<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" Class="mb-2">Find leads. Verify them. Reach them. Close them.</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-6">Phase 0 scaffold, restructured: each microservice is its own repo and solution (DDD), with a Postgres / MySQL switch per service. The frontend calls api.arishmasolutions.com (gateway), never a service directly. No live Apify run, email send, or payment yet.</MudText>
